              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रयास — prayās — \"an effort (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर सब मिलकर प्रयास करेंगे तो गाँव बदलेगा। agar sab milkar prayās kareṅge to gā̃v badlegā. If everyone makes an effort together, the village will change."
